  "details": "Basically, If you try to build an avatar with a per-platform override, but the inactive avatar is disabled in the hierarchy (e.g. the sdk is set to build PC first, but the Quest one is disabled), then the SDK will fail to build properly. I feel like this is an uncaught error, and should be handled. I can see two ways of doing this\n\n1: Automatically enabling the inactive avatar in the hierarchy if it is disabled when building\n\n2: Display some form of error popup in the sdk (preferably with an auto-fix button that enables the inactive avatar)",
